    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with his sore and great and strong sword shall punish leviathan the piercing serpent, even leviathan that crooked serpent; and he shall slay the dragon that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the sea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day sing ye unto her, A vineyard of red wine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "do keep it; I will water it every moment: lest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hurt it, I will keep it night and day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fury",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not in me: who would set the briers",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thorns against me in battle? I would go through them, I would burn them together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or let him take hold of my strength,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he may make peace with me;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he shall make peace with me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall cause them that come of Jacob to take root: Israel shall blossom and bud, and fill the face of the world with fruit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Hath he smitten him, as he smote those that smote him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is he slain according to the slaughter of them that are slain by him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In measure, when it shooteth forth, thou wilt debate with it: he stayeth his rough wind in the day of the east wind.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By this therefore shall the iniquity of Jacob be purged; and this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the fruit to take away his sin; when he maketh all the stones of the altar as chalkstones that are beaten in sunder, the groves and images shall not stand up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet the defenced city",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "desolate,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the habitation forsaken, and left like a wilderness: there shall the calf feed, and there shall he lie down, and consume the branches thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the boughs thereof are withered, they shall be broken off: the women come,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "set them on fire: for it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a people of no understanding: therefore he that made them will not have mercy on them, and he that formed them will shew them no favour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And it shall come to pass in that day,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall beat off from the channel of the river unto the stream of Egypt, and ye shall be gathered one by one, O ye children of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass in that day,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the great trumpet shall be blown, and they shall come which were ready to perish in the land of Assyria, and the outcasts in the land of Egypt, and shall worship the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.27.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the holy mount at Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
